      "adapter": "trackr",
      "chemEngRelevance": "high",
      "careersUrl": "https://app.the-trackr.com/uk-engineering",
      "params": {
        "region": "UK",
        "industry": "Engineering",
        "season": "2027",
        "siteSlug": "uk-engineering",
        "types": "summer-internships,industrial-placements,graduate-programmes,apprenticeships"
      },
      "verified": "2026-09-02",
      "notes": "The tracker exists in Trackr's app bundle (industry enum includes Engineering; categories include Chemicals & Oil, Energy & Utilities, Oil & Gas) but the /programmes endpoint returned an EMPTY envelope for every season and tab tested on 2026-09-02, while a UK Finance control returned 823 KB seconds later from the same IP. So this is armed and harmless: zero rows today, and it starts producing the day Trackr populates the board. Verified empty as a REAL empty envelope, not a throttle: the probe reproduced the throttle deliberately and it answers a bare [] instead."
    },
